## Architecture

```
worker-plan.html DNS09/DNS10 acceptance
        │
contract-freeze.json (354 hashes) ──► freeze applies to original D0 only
        │
effective-receipts/worksheet.json  (22 lessons / 159 cases; SHA d189ae38…)
   ├── setup.rrsets.{answer,signature,authorityProofs}   ← signed RRset identity
   ├── setup.responseInputs.{answer*,wildcardSignature,proofs} ← receipt declaration
   ├── setup.initialCache / nsec3 / selectedPolicy        ← pre-existing validated state
   ├── setup.numericBindings + evidenceBindingIndex       ← byte-level identity (no auth claim)
   ├── sequence[]                                         ← chronology (network-send/receive, checkpoints, clock)
   ├── checkpoints[].expected                             ← grouped observations incl. response.hops
   └── outcome                                            ← final resolver/app observation + duplicate hop view
        │
numeric/*.json (independent catalogs) ← actual RDATA/signing-input/hash bytes
```

Key separation enforced by all five rows: `received` ≠ `signatureChecked` ≠ `chainEstablished` ≠ `denialChecked` ≠ `acceptedForUse` ≠ `applicationResult`.

